# Data

The dataset used in this project is a person-period loan dataset of
49,982 loans provided by Rösch and Scheule (2020).

It is not included in this repository because it belongs to the original
authors. Please obtain it from the original source (the textbook's
companion data or the authors' website) and save it in this folder
as `loan_data.csv` before running the code.

The R scripts in the `code/` folder expect the file at `data/loan_data.csv`.
